  "body_html": "<div style=\"color:#11110E;line-height:1.55;\">\n<p style=\"font-size:1.35em;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#153252;margin:0 0 .6em;\">Douchekop én slang. Direct compleet.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 1.2em;\">De Besjaar Douchekop met drie standen, plus 1,5 meter flexibele slang. Lucht-verrijkte straal, maximaal 8 liter per minuut, alle bewegingsvrijheid. Oude set eraf, nieuwe erop – klaar.</p>\n<div style=\"background:#EEF6FB;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin:0 0 1.2em;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size:.8em;letter-spacing:.06em;font-weight:600;color:#49627D;margin:0 0 .7em;line-height:1.4;text-transform:none;\">Wat je merkt</h2>\n<ul style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;\">\n<li style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:0 0 .55em;font-size:.95em;color:#0F2947;\">\n<span style=\"flex:0 0 18px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#153252;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;text-align:center;display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;\">✓</span><span>Maximaal 8 liter per minuut (rekenvoorbeeld: een kop van 16 liter per minuut verbruikt twee keer zoveel)</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:0 0 .55em;font-size:.95em;color:#0F2947;\">\n<span style=\"flex:0 0 18px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#153252;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;text-align:center;display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;\">✓</span><span>3 standen: zachte regen, massage, krachtige power-straal</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:0 0 .55em;font-size:.95em;color:#0F2947;\">\n<span style=\"flex:0 0 18px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#153252;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;text-align:center;display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;\">✓</span><span>1,5 m flexibele slang met anti-draai bescherming</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:0 0 .55em;font-size:.95em;color:#0F2947;\">\n<span style=\"flex:0 0 18px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#153252;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;text-align:center;display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;\">✓</span><span>Extra brede kop van 13 cm</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:0 0 .55em;font-size:.95em;color:#0F2947;\">\n<span style=\"flex:0 0 18px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#153252;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;text-align:center;display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;\">✓</span><span>Siliconen sproeiers: kalk wrijf je met een vinger weg</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:0;font-size:.95em;color:#0F2947;\">\n<span style=\"flex:0 0 18px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#153252;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;text-align:center;display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;\">✓</span><span>Handvast gemonteerd met de meegeleverde afdichtingen</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:.8em;letter-spacing:.06em;font-weight:600;color:#49627D;margin:0 0 .7em;line-height:1.4;text-transform:none;\">In de doos</h2>\n<ul style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 1.2em;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;\">\n<li style=\"margin:0;font-size:.85em;color:#153252;border:1px solid #C9DBE8;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 11px;line-height:1.3;\">Besjaar Douchekop</li>\n<li style=\"margin:0;font-size:.85em;color:#153252;border:1px solid #C9DBE8;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 11px;line-height:1.3;\">Doucheslang 1,5 m</li>\n<li style=\"margin:0;font-size:.85em;color:#153252;border:1px solid #C9DBE8;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 11px;line-height:1.3;\">2× Afdichting</li>\n<li style=\"margin:0;font-size:.85em;color:#153252;border:1px solid #C9DBE8;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 11px;line-height:1.3;\">Waterbesparend onderdeel</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:.8em;letter-spacing:.06em;font-weight:600;color:#49627D;ma